    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An attractive own door two-bedroom apartment situated within The Innings, a highly regarded gated development on Observatory Lane in the heart of Rathmines Village. Enjoying a pleasant outlook over the grounds of Leinster Cricket Club, the property offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation comprising a spacious living/dining room with feature fireplace, separate kitchen, two bedrooms, bathroom and private balcony.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the apartment further benefits from reasonable service charge, secure gated parking, double glazed windows,  and the advantage of not being subject to RPZ restrictions.\r\n\r\nThe Innings is particularly popular with owner occupiers, ideally located within a short stroll of Rathmines Village and its extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities, including the Swan Shopping Centre, Swan Leisure Centre and Omniplex Cinema. St. Stephen's Green, Dublin City Centre and the Luas at Charlemont are all within easy reach. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall                                      3.37m x 1.71m                        With wood flooring and ample storage.\r\n\r\nLiving Room                                       4.14m x 3.61m                         Bright reception room with wood flooring, feature fireplace and coving to ceiling.\r\n\r\nKitchen                                               2.41m x 2.0m                           Fully fitted kitchen with tiled splashback and generous worktop space, plumbed for washing machine. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1                                        2.78m x 2.50m                           with fitted wardrobes and access to private balcony.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2                                       3.29m x 2.20m                            with fitted wardrobes and access to private balcony.\r\n\r\nBathroom                                        2.15m x 1.60m                            With bath, tiled shower area, wash hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nBalcony                                           5.00m x 1.19m                            Private balcony enjoying a pleasant outlook over the grounds of Leinster Cricket Club.\r\n\r\nOutside                                                                                               Landscaped grounds and surface car parking behind secure electronically controlled gates"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Attractive gated development\r\nOverlooking the grounds of Leinster Cricket Club\r\nPrivate balcony\r\nSecure designated parking\r\nNot subject to RPZ restrictions\r\nPrime Rathmines Village location\r\nIdeal home or investment opportunity\r\nElectric heating\r\nService charge: €1,100 per annum"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Rathmines Village, travelling towards Portobello Bridge, turn right onto Observatory Lane opposite the Lidl store and beside Ivy Nails & Beauty. The Innings is located at the end of the road on the left-hand side, where No. 17 is situated within the development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents."
      }
